Don't hang on to the corpse too long or it will spoil and give you food
poisoning (or eventually rot away completely). Only lichen and lizard
corpses will last without being tinned or put in an icebox. Tinning
kits are very useful for this reason; you can get intrinsics from tins
just like corpses, and they don't rot (and if the tinning kit is
blessed, it'll make spoiled corpses safe to eat).

